    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "名称暂不可用",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Design of a tape servomotor by the dominant second-order poles method to have no more than 5% overshoot and a rise time of no more than 4 sec. The desired poles are pc=[-0.707+0.707*j; -0.707-0.707*j; -4; -4; -4]/1.5. The resulting control gains are K2=[8.5123 20.3457 -1.4911 -7.8821 6.1927]. The step response shows a rise time of approximately 4 sec and overshoot of about 5%.",
